From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Feb 2026 08:14:57 +0530
Subject: feat: add Blink override hooks for 19 APIs via window.customOverrides

Implement JS override hooks for browser fingerprint spoofing using a
centralized window.customOverrides.{interfaceKey}.{overrideName} pattern
with a shared GetCustomOverrideFunction() helper.

Batch 1 (10 Web Audio APIs):
- AnalyserNode: getFloatFrequencyData, getByteFrequencyData,
  getFloatTimeDomainData, getByteTimeDomainData
- AudioBuffer: getChannelData
- AudioContext: baseLatency, outputLatency
- BaseAudioContext: createAnalyser, createDynamicsCompressor, createBuffer

Batch 2 (9 APIs):
- Cache: match, matchAll, add, addAll, put, delete, keys
- CanvasRenderingContext2D: getImageData
- crypto.subtle: encrypt

Also refactors pre-existing overrides (userAgent, userAgentData,
getHighEntropyValues) from per-object expando properties to the
centralized window.customOverrides lookup.

